WEBVTT

00:07:59.516 --> 00:08:02.436
construction is a big emission source,

00:08:02.436 --> 00:08:04.396
and in Oslo,

00:08:04.436 --> 00:08:10.276
the municipality accounts
for approximately 20 percent of everything

00:08:10.316 --> 00:08:11.836
that is being built.

00:08:12.396 --> 00:08:16.116
Our procurement framework awards companies

00:08:16.116 --> 00:08:19.276
who can provide zero-emission services.

00:08:20.036 --> 00:08:22.196
Since 2019,

00:08:23.276 --> 00:08:28.796
all projects by the municipality
have used this as a core tender criterium.

00:08:29.196 --> 00:08:31.716
This is important for contractors